  "metadata": {
    "title": "Decoder-only training is parallel; generation is sequential",
    "description": "A decoder-only Transformer uses a causal attention mask and next-token loss at every position. Teacher forcing computes those positions in parallel during training; sampling generates one token at a time and appends it to the prefix."
